    step 7 shows "staff competent" from 14 to 15.
    step 7 ends from 15 to 16.
    the session ends from 16 to 17.

scenario violating is:
    % Ponens (`ponens trace check --json`):
    %     acts_in_client_best_interest: failed at step 2
    %     ai_complaints_recorded: failed at step 6
    %     ai_information_clear_fair: failed at step 1
    %     ai_information_monitored: failed at step 1
    %     ai_output_accuracy_controlled: failed at step 1
    %     ai_records_maintained: failed at step 1
    %     ai_stress_tested: failed at step 3
    %     ai_tested_before_deployment: failed at step 3
    %     ai_use_disclosed_to_client: failed at step 1
    %     outsourced_ai_due_diligence: failed at step 5
    %     product_governance_aligned: failed at step 4
    %     recommendation_suitable: failed at step 2
    %     training_data_representative: failed at step 3
    step 1 shows "client facing" from 2 to 3.
    step 1 shows "ai driven information" from 2 to 3.
    step 1 is a Output from 2 to 3.
    step 1 shows "client interaction" from 2 to 3.
    step 1 ends from 3 to 4.
    step 2 is a Recommendation from 4 to 5.
    step 2 ends from 5 to 6.
    step 3 is a Deploy from 6 to 7.
    step 3 ends from 7 to 8.
    step 4 is a Distribution from 8 to 9.
    step 4 ends from 9 to 10.
    step 5 shows "third party ai" from 10 to 11.
    step 5 ends from 11 to 12.
    step 6 shows "complaint" from 12 to 13.
    step 6 ends from 13 to 14.
    the session ends from 14 to 15.
